1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:00,860
M: Hello, Ms. Wilson.

2
00:00:01,700 --> 00:00:02,660
This is Mark Daniels.

3
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:05,580
I regret to inform you that I'll be a few minutes late for our meeting.

4
00:00:06,245 --> 00:00:06,980
W: What's the problem?

5
00:00:07,480 --> 00:00:08,340
Are you stuck in traffic?

6
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:14,580
M: No, but I missed the exit for your office, so I had to drive for ten minutes until I could turn around.

7
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:16,835
I should be there in fifteen minutes.

8
00:00:17,315 --> 00:00:20,920
W: Okay, but please be aware that I have to leave by 2:30.

9
00:00:21,605 --> 00:00:23,780
I'm meeting with the CEO of my firm then.

10
00:00:24,620 --> 00:00:26,620
Will you have enough time for the demonstration?

11
00:00:27,780 --> 00:00:28,560
M: More than enough.

12
00:00:29,010 --> 00:00:31,660
You'll be able to see everything our new laptop can do.

13
00:00:31,965 --> 00:00:32,160
W: Great.

14
00:00:32,645 --> 00:00:33,975
I'm looking forward to it.
